  "coverage_qualification": [
    "All spaces and operators are the actual sealed original test and current spaces; the literal final topology is unchanged.",
    "The affine homotopy is used into the full Euclidean ambient space. No uniform enlargement of the time interval mapping all U into U is assumed.",
    "The original compact test is zero extended, and the preceding actual transgression gives a smooth primitive on U. The primitive is not claimed compactly supported.",
    "The published erratum corrects D_j to D^j in the p.364 line11 test-form assertion. The exact original test class and the velocity integral are retained.",
