    "Exact support lies in the original compact segment union. Star-shapedness puts that union inside U and proves compact support of the open cone.",
    "The positive-current identity requires positive input degree; the positive top-dimensional vanishing theorem excludes the nonzero degree-zero R^0 boundary.",
    "The separate zero-current formula keeps the T(1) delta_u term, including the actual nonzero R^0 point-current regression.",
